ons]], sliced into half-moons\n* Green [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|bell peppers]], cut into small pieces\n* Greek [[Cookbook:Olive|olives]]\n* Extra-virgin or virgin [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n* Vinegar or lemon juice\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Salt]]\n* [[Cookbook:Feta Cheese|Feta cheese]]\n* [[Cookbook:Oregano|Oregano]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Combine tomatoes, cucumbers, onions, peppers, and olives in a deep bowl.\n#Add enough olive oil, vinegar or lemon juice, and salt to taste. [[Cookbook:Mixing#Tossing|Toss]] the ingredients for half a minute.\n#Place a feta cheese slice on top and season with a splash of olive oil.\n#Top with a sprig of oregano if desired.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for salad]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green bell pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cucumber]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive]]\n[[Category:Recipes using salt]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cheese]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oregano]]\n[[Category:Recipes using feta]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Greek Salad","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"Red tomatoes, chopped","sourceText":"Red tomatoes, chopped","amountText":"Red tomatoes, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"Cucumber, sliced into rounds","sourceText":"Cucumber, sliced into rounds","amountText":"Cucumber, sliced into rounds","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Red or white onions, sliced into half-moons","sourceText":"Red or white onions, sliced into half-moons","amountText":"Red or white onions, sliced into half-moons","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Green bell peppers, cut into small pieces","sourceText":"Green bell peppers, cut into small pieces","amountText":"Green bell peppers, cut into small pieces","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5",